    "verdict": "The 5₂ Stokes matrix S⁺(x;q) is assembled from the m015 3d index through GGM's gauge (eqs Sp-52, Wmatrec, W52xm) and a block-to-index dictionary measured from GGM's own holomorphic blocks: Bil = E·N·E⁻¹, e_k = (-q^k x²)^k. It reproduces S⁺(x;0) = [[1,s+1,0],[0,1,0],[-s,-s²,1]] (GGM eq S0px52), det = 1, the printed 𝒮⁺_{σ₁σ₁} and, at x = 1, the independent W-route S⁺(q). The Stokes constants 4 = S⁺₁₂(1;0) and -3 = S⁺₃₁(1;0) are read from finitely many index coefficients; they are signed sums with cancellations, not positive state counts."
